+  `Game#keep_time` first (`Moderate::GamesController#show`, `Moderate::Games::*`
+  incl. the counters poll, `Play::BaseController`, `PlayChannel#sync`): it
+  finishes an overdue question at once, or schedules the running one again.
+  Measured: a restart in the middle of a 12 s question, and it still finished
+  at 12.1 s (the big screen's next poll re-armed it).
+- Picks are refused from `closes_at` on (`Round#record_answer` compares the
+  time the pick was taken, before the transaction), even if the round is not
+  closed yet: a pick made in time but processed a moment later still counts.
